#!/usr/bin/env python3.12
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  WINDOWSINTHEAPPLE  ·  v2.2  ·  PUNKS / AEGIS
  v2.2: hide instantly on a missed tick but only destroy/rebuild after
  MISS_TOLERANCE consecutive misses — v2.1's hysteresis fixed the flicker
  but left a "ghost" mask/lights box lingering at a closed/switched
  window's last position for a few ticks. Also carries v2.1's screen-aware
  fullscreen guard (v2.0's guard always checked bounds against the PRIMARY
  display even for windows on a secondary monitor).
  Traffic lights on the RIGHT. Covered content mirrored on the LEFT.
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  Architecture (per skinned window):
    ┌─ LEFT MASK ──────────┐          ┌─ RIGHT LIGHTS ────────────┐
    │ covers native ●●●    │   ....   │ draws ● ● ● (hover glyphs)│
    │ shows LIVE MIRROR of │          │ clicks → AXPress on the  │
    │ the strip our lights │          │ REAL close/min/zoom       │
    │ overlay covers       │          │ buttons                   │
    └──────────────────────┘          └───────────────────────────┘

  · Skins ALL windows of the frontmost app (z-order-correct illusion).
  · 20 Hz position tracking, 2 Hz heavy refresh (mirror capture, colors).
  · Live mirror uses CGWindowListCreateImage (macOS ≤ 14). On macOS 15+
    where Apple removed it, falls back to a sampled-color solid mask.
  · Fullscreen + tiny-window guards (carried over from v1).
  · Zero AX polling in the hot loop — AX touched only on click + rescan.

  Permissions required (System Settings → Privacy & Security):
    · Accessibility      (button clicks, window control)
    · Screen Recording   (live mirror; optional — degrades gracefully)

  CLI:
    python3.12 WindowsintheApple.py            run in foreground
    python3.12 WindowsintheApple.py --debug    verbose logging
    python3.12 WindowsintheApple.py --install  write + load launchd agent
    python3.12 WindowsintheApple.py --uninstall
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
"""

